      "table_context_mentions_column_and_precision": [
        {
          "path": "/home/katherine/dac/benchmarks/dacomp-de/dacomp-de-impl-014/docs/data_contract.yaml",
          "line": 1159,
          "original_text": "      business_logic: '- Load survey_performance with survey_id, survey_name, survey_status, total_responses, completed_responses, completion_rate, and avg_completion_time_seconds. - Load response_quality with survey_id, response_id, include_in_analysis, quality_score, and overall_quality_rating. - Build a quality_summary per survey_id: - total_assessed_responses = number of distinct response_id values. - high_quality_responses = number of responses where include_in_analysis is true; false or null are not counted. - avg_quality_score = average of quality_score values; records with null quality_score are ignored; no rounding. - excellent_responses = number of responses where overall_quality_rating equals \"High Quality\" (exact string match). - Left join survey_performance to quality_summary by survey_id. - When quality_summary is missing, set avg_quality_score, high_quality_responses, and excellent_responses to 0; if avg_quality_score is null, use 0. - Compute quality_adjusted_completion_rate: - If total_responses > 0 and total_assessed_responses > 0, multiply completion_rate by the fraction high_quality_responses / total_responses (fractional division; no truncation); otherwise use completion_rate; if completion_rate is null, the result is null. - Assign performance_tier using inclusive thresholds: - High Performer when completion_rate ≥ 0.8 and avg_quality_score (using 0 when missing) ≥ 80. - Good Performer when completion_rate ≥ 0.6 and avg_quality_score (using 0 when missing) ≥ 60. - Average Performer when completion_rate ≥ 0.4. - Otherwise Needs Improvement. - Compute roi_score as completion_rate * 60 plus avg_quality_score (using 0 when missing) * 0.4; if completion_rate is null, roi_score is null; no rounding. - Set analysis_date to the current timestamp (same value for all rows in a run). - Filter out surveys where total_responses ≤ 0 or total_responses is null. - Order the final output by roi_score descending.'\n",
          "association": "同一原文行同时提及列名和 precision/rounding/format/type-conversion 关键词；未判定语句适用范围"
        }
